I am in the office.
The office is very cool.
There is a large window here.
I am standing near the window.
Rohan is also standing here.
We both look outside.
There is harsh sunshine outside.
It is very hot today.
He says, "Maya, today is very hot."
I smile.
I say, "Rohan, it will rain today."
Rohan asks, "Really?"
"Will it rain today?"
I say, "Yes, there is a forecast on my mobile."
"It will rain in the evening."
Rohan smiles.
He says, "Great, then the weather will be cool."
Rohan is happy.
I resume work on the computer.
